 }
+
+// REWINDBOX_FLIP_DONE_REPLAY_935 (ios/IOSFlipDoneReplay.h): Black Ops II stops for good after a few minutes of play
+// on IPA 723, 724 and 726 (PIDs 48320, 50194 and 54406): in each freeze dump its PPU thread "Backend" polls the flip
+// status word (0x40201100, head 1 flipFlags) in a sys_timer_usleep(1000) loop while main_thread waits for it and
+// the RSX stands on a jump to itself. The game clears the "flip done" bit after it made the flip visible; a flip
+// that completed in between is erased by that clear. Scoped to the title whose dumps show it.
